  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Citi - Youlima Youth Incubator Cohorts 3 &amp; 4</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Bukavu in the Democratic Republic of Congo, USADF and Citi will hold a business plan competition that feeds into an incubator program for at least 30 youth-led business ventures. After completing the Program, 20 of these youth entrepreneurs will receive $5,000 in seed capital to start or expand their ventures.</narrative>
  </description>
